# Ketch

> Ketch is enterprise data privacy management software for consent, DSARs, data mapping, AI and assessments—built for GDPR, CCPA, and US state laws. Start free.

Ketch is permissioning infrastructure for the AI era. We help organizations capture consent, govern how data is used, enforce those rules across every system, and turn permissioned data into AI-ready growth — organized in three layers: Discovery (see everything), Permissioning (control everything), and Growth (use everything, safely).

## Positioning

- **Category**: Permissioning infrastructure for the AI era — formerly known as data privacy / privacy management software.
- **Three-layer value chain**: Discovery → Permissioning → Growth. Every product fits one layer.
- **Production scale**: 67.2B consent transactions/month across 3,500+ brands; 30.8B CDN requests/month.
- **Differentiators**: Ketch Agent Network, free tier with full-feature CMP, Identity Sync, transparent pricing, OneTrust migration in a week.

## Platform — Top Level

- [Platform Overview](https://www.ketch.com/platform/overview): Ketch Platform simplifies privacy operations by automating consent, data mapping, DSR workflows, and AI-ready data governance, enabling responsible data use and growth.
- [Ketch Agent Network](https://www.ketch.com/platform/agent-network): AI agents that do privacy work, not just answer questions about it. Ketch Agent Network automates DSRs, consent, assessments, and more across your entire stack.

## Platform — Discovery layer (see everything)

- [Data Sentry](https://www.ketch.com/platform/data-sentry): Ketch Data Sentry is a website privacy compliance scan — the industry's first privacy pentest for your digital properties. Detect vulnerabilities before regulators do.
- [Data Mapping](https://www.ketch.com/platform/data-mapping): Ketch data mapping software maps consumer data and risk across the business — from system inventory to ROPA in four steps.
- [Data Discovery & Classification](https://www.ketch.com/platform/data-discovery): Ketch is a data discovery and classification tool that finds and classifies personal data for every row, column, and cell — AI-powered system discovery.

## Platform — Permissioning layer (control everything)

- [Consent Management](https://www.ketch.com/platform/consent-management): Ketch is a consent management platform (CMP) for every law and regulation with customizable banners to match your brand, increase value and build trust with consumers.
- [DSR Automation](https://www.ketch.com/platform/dsr-automation): Ketch DSR automation software collapses the cost of compliance with custom workflow design that fits your business processes.
- [Risk Management](https://www.ketch.com/platform/risk-management-and-reporting): Run DPIA, TIA, and PIA assessments in a fraction of the time. Ketch automates privacy risk workflows so your team can focus on decisions, not admin.
- [AI Governance](https://www.ketch.com/platform/ai-governance): AI models are only as trustworthy as the data inside them. Ketch AI Governance — powered by AI Sentry — is the real-time enforcement layer that keeps unpermissioned data out of your AI stack.

## Platform — Growth layer (use everything, safely)

- [Marketing Preference Management](https://www.ketch.com/platform/marketing-preference-management): Improve your first-party data collection with on-brand, global collection and management of marketing communications preferences.
- [Progressive Consent](https://www.ketch.com/platform/progressive-consent): Ketch's Progressive Consent seamlessly integrates privacy choices into user journeys, enhancing trust, boosting engagement, and enriching first-party data collection.
- [Profile Management](https://www.ketch.com/platform/profile-management): Ketch is a customer profile management platform that turns permissioned data into AI-ready customer profiles.

## Solutions — By Role

- [Website Tracker Scanning](https://www.ketch.com/solutions/website-tracker-scanning): Tags, scripts, trackers and cookie scanning: leverage automated, proactive tracker scanning to bring clarity and control to your website's tracking landscape.
- [Do Not Sell or Share](https://www.ketch.com/solutions/do-not-sell-or-share): Simplify CCPA compliance with Do Not Sell or Share My Personal Information thanks to Ketch's location-aware tools and no-code integrations.
- [Privacy Frameworks](https://www.ketch.com/solutions/privacy-frameworks): Ketch automates compliance across GPP, GPC, TCF & Consent Mode v2. Streamline privacy signals, honor user choices & stay audit-ready everywhere.
- [Identity Management](https://www.ketch.com/solutions/identity-management): Unify identities across browsers, devices, and sessions to ensure accurate, consent-aware privacy experiences with Ketch identity management.
- [Demand Letters Response](https://www.ketch.com/solutions/demand-letters): Evaluate a CIPA, pixel-tracking, or DSR demand letter with consent records, live property scans, and HAR file analysis before you decide how to respond.
- [Agentic Risk Assessments](https://www.ketch.com/solutions/agentic-risk-assessments): Most privacy risk tools find the problem. Ketch Agent Network drafts the fix. The agent observes your environment, prioritizes findings, drafts the remediation, and stages the work for your team's approval.
- [Age Gating](https://www.ketch.com/solutions/age-gating): Deliver dynamic consent controls that help brands comply with children’s privacy laws without breaking the user journey.

